    {
      "exercise": "834", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "提出根号内的平方因数，再合并同类根式：\na) $\\sqrt{75}+\\sqrt{48}-\\sqrt{300}=(5+4-10)\\sqrt3=-\\sqrt3$。\nb) $3\\sqrt8+2\\sqrt{18}-\\sqrt{50}=(6+6-5)\\sqrt2=7\\sqrt2$。\nc) $\\sqrt{242}-\\sqrt{200}+\\sqrt8=(11-10+2)\\sqrt2=3\\sqrt2$。\nd) $\\sqrt{54}+\\sqrt{96}-\\sqrt{150}=(3+4-5)\\sqrt6=2\\sqrt6$。\ne) $6\\sqrt{\\frac13}-\\sqrt{12}+\\sqrt3=(2-2+1)\\sqrt3=\\sqrt3$。\nf) $40\\sqrt{\\frac25}-\\sqrt{1000}+2\\sqrt{10}=(8-10+2)\\sqrt{10}=0$。",
      "notes": "Six original simplification tasks. All derived; no lookup or old answer key used."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "835", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "先合并同类根式，查表得 $\\sqrt2\\approx1.414$、$\\sqrt3\\approx1.732$、$\\sqrt5\\approx2.236$。\na) $(3+4-10)\\sqrt2=-3\\sqrt2\\approx-4.242$。\nb) $(12-5-4)\\sqrt2=3\\sqrt2\\approx4.242$。\nc) $(5+1-4)\\sqrt3=2\\sqrt3\\approx2\\cdot1.732=3.464$。\nd) $(4+1+9)\\sqrt5=14\\sqrt5\\approx14\\cdot2.236=31.304$。\ne) $(5-1-3)\\sqrt3=\\sqrt3\\approx1.732$。\nf) $(7-6+1)\\sqrt2=2\\sqrt2\\approx2.828$。\n报告约定：先精确化简，再代入已审读的三位小数表值，列出表值运算结果（保留三位小数）。这些数是查表近似值，不保证原式真值按三位小数舍入也得到同一结果。",
      "notes": "Six tasks, all exact simplifications retained. RECOVERY1 completes only 835.c/d/e using newly disclosed literal Table IV sqrt(3)=1,732 and sqrt(5)=2,236 main cells. FIRST 835.a/b/f lookup results and lines are unchanged. Table-substitution reporting convention is explicit; no true-value rounding, tie or error guarantee."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "836", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "展开乘法并化简根式：\na) $15-2\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{15}=15$。\nb) $21-2\\sqrt{21}+2\\sqrt{21}=21$。\nc) $\\sqrt6+6-4\\sqrt6=6-3\\sqrt6$。\nd) $24-4\\sqrt{18}-2\\sqrt3=24-12\\sqrt2-2\\sqrt3$。\ne) $6+5+2\\sqrt{30}-2\\sqrt{30}=11$。\nf) $14+18-6\\sqrt{28}+6\\sqrt{28}=32$。",
      "notes": "Six original tasks. The product in d) is the whole parenthesized expression times 2sqrt(3)."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "837", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "提取公因式：\na) $\\sqrt7(\\sqrt2-1)$。\nb) $\\sqrt{11}(\\sqrt3+\\sqrt2)$。\nc) $\\sqrt3(\\sqrt5-\\sqrt2)$。\nd) $\\sqrt3(\\sqrt3+1)$。\ne) $\\sqrt{10}(\\sqrt{10}-2)$。\nf) $\\sqrt a(\\sqrt a-5)$，原式的实数定义域为 $a\\ge0$。\ng) $\\sqrt b(\\sqrt b-3)$，其中 $b\\ge0$。\nh) $\\sqrt b(\\sqrt b-\\sqrt3)$，其中 $b\\ge0$。\n逐项乘开可还原原式，包括 e) 的 $10-2\\sqrt{10}$。",
      "notes": "Eight original factorization tasks, with real radical domains retained."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "838", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "把分子和分母分解为公因式，再在原分母不为零的范围内约去：\na) $\\frac{\\sqrt2(1+\\sqrt2)}{\\sqrt2}=1+\\sqrt2$。\nb) $\\frac{\\sqrt5(\\sqrt5+\\sqrt2)}{\\sqrt5\\sqrt2}=1+\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}2$。\nc) $\\frac{\\sqrt3(2-\\sqrt3)}{5\\sqrt3}=\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{5}$。\nd) $\\frac{\\sqrt a\\sqrt b(\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b)}{\\sqrt a\\sqrt b}=\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b$，原式要求 $a>0,b>0$。\ne) $\\frac{\\sqrt x(\\sqrt x-\\sqrt a)}{a\\sqrt x}=\\frac{\\sqrt x-\\sqrt a}{a}$，原式要求 $a>0,x>0$。\nf) $\\frac{\\sqrt y(\\sqrt y+b)}{b\\sqrt y}=1+\\frac{\\sqrt y}{b}$，原式要求 $y>0,b\\ne0$。\ng) $\\frac{\\sqrt2(\\sqrt2+1)}{1+\\sqrt2}=\\sqrt2$。\nh) $\\frac{\\sqrt5(\\sqrt3-1)}{-(\\sqrt3-1)}=-\\sqrt5$。\ni) $\\frac{\\sqrt6(\\sqrt2-1)}{2(\\sqrt2-1)}=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}$。\n约分后的式子即使在某些新点有定义，也不能扩大原式的定义域。",
      "notes": "Nine original cancellation tasks. In f), b need not be positive, but it cannot be zero."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "839", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "在原式的定义域内分解并约去公因式：\na) $\\frac{\\sqrt x(\\sqrt x+\\sqrt y)}{\\sqrt x+\\sqrt y}=\\sqrt x$，其中 $x\\ge0,y\\ge0,x+y>0$。\nb) $\\frac{\\sqrt x(\\sqrt x-1)}{\\sqrt x-1}=\\sqrt x$，其中 $x\\ge0,x\\ne1$。\nc) $\\frac{\\sqrt a(\\sqrt a+\\sqrt6)}{\\sqrt6(\\sqrt a+\\sqrt6)}=\\frac{\\sqrt a}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{\\sqrt{6a}}6$，其中 $a\\ge0$。\nd) $\\frac{\\sqrt p(\\sqrt p-2)}{2(\\sqrt p-2)}=\\frac{\\sqrt p}{2}$，其中 $p\\ge0,p\\ne4$。\ne) $\\frac{(\\sqrt a-2)(\\sqrt a+2)}{\\sqrt a-2}=\\sqrt a+2$，其中 $a\\ge0,a\\ne4$。\nf) $\\frac{(\\sqrt b-3)(\\sqrt b+3)}{\\sqrt b+3}=\\sqrt b-3$，其中 $b\\ge0$；分母在这个范围内总为正。",
      "notes": "Six original tasks. All removable singularities remain excluded from the original domains."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "840", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "利用非负数的平方比较大小，不需要查表：\na) $\\sqrt{2.5}>\\frac{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3}{2}$。两边平方的差为 $\\frac{5-2\\sqrt6}{4}>0$，因为 $25>24$。\nb) $\\sqrt{11}-1<\\sqrt5+\\sqrt7$。右式的平方为 $12+2\\sqrt{35}>11$，所以 $\\sqrt5+\\sqrt7>\\sqrt{11}>\\sqrt{11}-1$。\nc) $\\sqrt2+\\sqrt7>2\\sqrt2+1$。只需比较 $\\sqrt7$ 与 $\\sqrt2+1$；平方之差 $7-(3+2\\sqrt2)=4-2\\sqrt2>0$。\nd) $\\sqrt5+\\sqrt7>3+\\sqrt3$。两边平方分别为 $12+2\\sqrt{35}$ 和 $12+6\\sqrt3$；由 $35>27$ 得 $\\sqrt{35}>3\\sqrt3$，故前者较大。",
      "notes": "Four original comparisons. Squaring is used only after establishing nonnegative comparison quantities."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "841", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "按平方差公式，并注意每题两个因子的次序：\na) $3-1=2$。\nb) $11-9=2$。\nc) $7^2-(\\sqrt{10})^2=49-10=39$。\nd) $(2\\sqrt5)^2-(\\sqrt{19})^2=20-19=1$。\ne) $(5\\sqrt7)^2-13^2=175-169=6$。\nf) $(\\sqrt3)^2-\\left(\\frac12\\sqrt{14}\\right)^2=3-\\frac{14}{4}=-\\frac12$。",
      "notes": "Six original difference-of-squares tasks; f) is negative, not positive."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "842", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "把分母中的共轭式相乘，直接求出有理数值：\na) $\\frac{(3\\sqrt2+4)-(3\\sqrt2-4)}{(3\\sqrt2-4)(3\\sqrt2+4)}=\\frac8{18-16}=4$。\nb) $\\frac{(5-2\\sqrt6)+(5+2\\sqrt6)}{(5+2\\sqrt6)(5-2\\sqrt6)}=\\frac{10}{25-24}=10$。\n两个分母的乘积分别为 2 和 1，均非零；因此原式都有意义，所得的 4、10 都是有理数，证明完成。",
      "notes": "Two original rationality proof tasks; gives the actual values and denominator checks."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "843", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "分子、分母同乘分母的共轭式，先完成精确化简：\na) $\\frac{2(\\sqrt5+\\sqrt3)}{5-3}=\\sqrt5+\\sqrt3\\approx2.236+1.732=3.968$。\nb) $\\frac{3(\\sqrt{10}-\\sqrt7)}{10-7}=\\sqrt{10}-\\sqrt7\\approx3.162-2.646=0.516$。\nc) $\\frac{\\sqrt5+2}{5-4}=\\sqrt5+2\\approx2.236+2=4.236$。\nd) $\\frac{4(3-\\sqrt7)}{9-7}=6-2\\sqrt7\\approx6-2\\cdot2.646=0.708$。\ne) $\\frac{9+4\\sqrt5}{81-80}=9+4\\sqrt5\\approx9+4\\cdot2.236=17.944$。\nf) $\\frac{5\\sqrt2+7}{50-49}=5\\sqrt2+7\\approx5\\cdot1.414+7=14.070$。\n查表得 $\\sqrt2\\approx1.414$、$\\sqrt3\\approx1.732$、$\\sqrt5\\approx2.236$、$\\sqrt7\\approx2.646$、$\\sqrt{10}\\approx3.162$。报告约定：先精确化简，再代入已审读的三位小数表值，列出表值运算结果（保留三位小数）。这些数是查表近似值，不保证原式真值按三位小数舍入也得到同一结果。",
      "notes": "Six tasks, all exact conjugate simplifications retained. RECOVERY1 completes only 843.a/b/c/d/e using disclosed Table IV sqrt(3),sqrt(5),sqrt(7),sqrt(10) main cells; no corrections required. FIRST 843.f and its sqrt(2)-based result 14.070 are unchanged. Results report finite printed-cell substitution, not guaranteed true-value rounding or a Bradis tie/error policy."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "844", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "当 $a,b\\ge0$ 时，两边均非负。比较平方：\n$\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{a+b}{2}}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{a+b-2\\sqrt{ab}}4=\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{4}\\ge0$。\n非负数的平方越大，其本身也越大，所以 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a+b}{2}}\\ge\\frac{\\sqrt a+\\sqrt b}{2}$。等号当且仅当 $a=b$，包括 $a=b=0$。",
      "notes": "One original general proof task; nonnegativity and equality case included."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "845", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "$\\frac{a+b}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{ab}$，因为在 $a,b\\ge0$ 时，\n$\\frac{a+b}{2}-\\sqrt{ab}=\\frac{a+b-2\\sqrt a\\sqrt b}{2}=\\frac{(\\sqrt a-\\sqrt b)^2}{2}\\ge0$。\n当且仅当 $a=b$ 时取等号；当 $a\\ne b$ 时，$\\frac{a+b}{2}$ 严格大于 $\\sqrt{ab}$。",
      "notes": "One original parameter comparison, with all nonnegative boundary cases covered."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "846", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "a) 原式要求 $a-b\\ne0$。交叉相乘：$s(a-b)=m(a+b)$，整理为 $(s+m)b=a(s-m)$。通常在 $s+m\\ne0$ 时，\n$b=\\frac{a(s-m)}{s+m}$。\n还须保持原分母非零；此时 $a-b=\\frac{2am}{s+m}$，所以有效解要求 $am\\ne0$。若 $s+m=0$ 且 $am=0$，原方程允许任意 $b\\ne a$；其余退化参数情况无有效解。\n\nb) 原式要求 $R\\ne0$。展开得 $d^2=2Rh+h^2$，所以在 $h\\ne0$ 时，\n$R=\\frac{d^2-h^2}{2h}$。\n该解还须满足 $d^2\\ne h^2$，否则会得到原式不允许的 $R=0$。若 $h=0,d=0$，任意 $R\\ne0$ 均可；若 $h=0,d\\ne0$，则无解。这里仅按题面给出的实数关系讨论，不额外假定参数为正。",
      "notes": "Two original formula-rearrangement tasks. Includes original denominator exclusions and degenerate branches, rather than canceling a potentially zero factor."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "847", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "在实数范围内求解：\na) $x(x-27)=0$，所以 $x=0,27$。\nb) $y(3y-7)=0$，所以 $y=0,\\frac73$。\nc) $(4y-1)(4y+1)=0$，所以 $y=-\\frac14,\\frac14$。\nd) $4x^2+1\\ge1>0$，故没有实数根。\ne) $x^2=5$，所以 $x=-\\sqrt5,\\sqrt5$。\nf) $x^2=\\frac{0.9}{3}=\\frac3{10}$，所以 $x=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac3{10}}=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}{10}$。\n凡平方等于正数的题都保留正、负两个根；代回原方程可校验。",
      "notes": "Six original equations. Exact radical roots require no table lookup."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "848", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "按图 56 的字母和坐标网格对应：\n$y=1.5x+2$ 对应直线 a：它向右上升，过 $(0,2)$，向右 2 格升高 3 格，斜率为 $\\frac32$。\n$y=-2x+2$ 对应直线 b：它向右下降，过 $(0,2)$ 和 $(1,0)$，斜率为 -2。\n$y=-\\frac{x}{4}-3$ 对应直线 c：它缓慢向右下降，过 $(0,-3)$ 和 $(-12,0)$，斜率为 $-\\frac14$。\n前两条直线虽然同过纵轴上的 2，但斜率的正负和陡缓不同，不能交换它们的字母。",
      "notes": "Three original equation-to-label tasks. Actually viewed fig-56 raw PNG and current width640 preview once each, and read current FigureSpec; no independent figure approval claimed."
    },
    {
      "exercise": "849", "grading": "ungraded", "source": "derived", "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "由图 57 的单位网格读两个点，先求斜率，再取纵轴截距。\n直线 a 过 $(0,-2)$ 和 $(10,0)$，所以斜率 $k=\\frac{0-(-2)}{10-0}=\\frac15$，截距为 -2，方程是 $y=\\frac15x-2$。\n直线 b 过 $(0,1)$ 和 $(1,-1)$，所以斜率 $k=\\frac{-1-1}{1-0}=-2$，截距为 1，方程是 $y=-2x+1$；图上的 $(2,-3)$ 也符合这个方程。\n原图和当前现代图的字母、线的上升或下降方向及这些网格读数一致。",
      "notes": "Two original line-equation tasks. Actually viewed fig-57 raw PNG and current width640 preview once each, and read current FigureSpec; grid readings are not invented point markers."
